        "body": "Jacobs Engineering Group obligations are up 194.6% year over year. Jacobs Engineering Group obligated $274M so far in FY2026, compared with FY25 $93M, FY24 $64M, FY23 $52.6M, FY22 $27.5M, and FY21 $33.4M. Jacobs Engineering Group average award size in FY2026 to date is $1.9M across 147 awards."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are Jacobs Engineering Group's top federal customers and what markets do they buy?",
        "body": "Department of Homeland Security is the top buyer of Jacobs Engineering Group at $151M, followed by Department of Defense at $36.6M and General Services Administration at $34.6M. Jacobs Engineering Group sells primarily Engineering Services at $243M, with additional obligations in Architectural Services at $14.6M and Remediation Services at $9.4M."
      }
